e as quiet as the grave, or she’ll pick you out in an instant.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.192,"end":14.784,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":50},"large":{"start":0.192,"end":14.784,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":50},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Flatten yourself against the wall and hold your breath for 10 seconds so you don’t get noticed. Yes, now!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":15.584,"end":20.672,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"large":{"start":15.584,"end":20.672,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"She grimaces and looks suspiciously in your direction. But after a moment, she adjusts her glasses and moves on. You're safe for now.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":30.784,"end":41.632,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"large":{"start":30.784,"end":41.6,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You celebrate your victory by taking another image to fill the second empty quadrant of your pirate coat of arms. Your ability to think under pressure is clearly worth expressing there.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":42.304,"end":53.12,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"large":{"start":42.304,"end":53.12,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"Open your Pirate Captain App to take your photo!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":54.016,"end":56.544,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":54.016,"end":56.544,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"sm